        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Document type() method for Memory, Table, and Global]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43422</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43422"/>
        <updated>2026-03-12T23:37:48.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217326?u=a4cdaefc3a39658f4d104b96ec8c78f10ac63d12&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h2 dir="auto">Summary</h2>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Add documentation pages for <code class="notranslate">type()</code> instance method on <code class="notranslate">WebAssembly.Memory</code>, <code class="notranslate">WebAssembly.Table</code>, and <code class="notranslate">WebAssembly.Global</code></li>
<li>These methods are part of the <a href="https://github.com/WebAssembly/js-types">WebAssembly js-types proposal</a> and return objects describing the type of each construct</li>
<li>List <code class="notranslate">type()</code> in each object's instance methods section on their parent pages</li>
<li>Follows the existing format established by <code class="notranslate">WebAssembly.Tag.prototype.type()</code></li>
</ul>
<h2 dir="auto">Motivation</h2>
<p dir="auto">The js-types proposal adds <code class="notranslate">type()</code> methods to Memory, Table, and Global, but only <code class="notranslate">Tag.type()</code> is currently documented on MDN. The issue notes these methods are implemented in Safari and meet MDN's documentation criteria.</p>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #41157.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3421949146" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41157" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/41157/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41157">#41157</a>.</p>
<h2 dir="auto">Test plan</h2>
<ul class="contains-task-list">
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Incomplete task"> New pages render correctly</li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Incomplete task"> Browser compatibility tables load (via <code class="notranslate">browser-compat</code> keys)</li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Incomplete task"> Parent page instance method lists link correctly</li>
</ul>]]></content>
